  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When life chasing fire forces Unfettered Scholar off Dong Fang Chang Fan, he uses thousand disintegrations on himself to cancel that fire. Pi Shui Han later says they will have to rely on Unfettered Scholar to solve big to small, and Unfettered Scholar uses thousand disintegrations on Miniscule Mountain; big to small counters that strike.",
        "chapters": [
          801
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "countering-fire-and-miniscule-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_dong_fang_chang_fan",
          "char_pi_shui_han"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During the contest over the ruin bat corpse and blood veil, Old Lord Can Yang recognizes thousand disintegrations. He says Chen clan specialized in rule path, and that among its Gu Immortals rank six could use hundred disintegrations, rank seven thousand disintegrations, and rank eight myriad disintegrations. He also says that killer move can attack as well as defend, disintegrating almost any mysterious elements.",
        "chapters": [
          790
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "countering-fire-and-miniscule-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
